# Pinned inputs for the a14m Ubuntu Touch port.
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>
# A line containing TBD makes fetch-inputs.sh stop with INPUTS_NOT_PINNED.
# Download URLs live in inputs.urls (same directory). INPUTS_MIRROR, when set,
# overrides the host path for every file (useful for mirroring into Releases).
#
# Kernel: released v1.6.1 boot.img from the behi kernel repo. It already carries
# every config option restated by halium_ut.config, so it is byte-compatible
# with the UT test branch until its own CI artifact replaces it.
d5078f5d8a5bf9f73ba1ef8d3cec7cf5181a39c79432b9e0f663c0d220b62458  kernel-ut-boot.img
e657f8f51a5d5c7eb29f00f9ed543315799375f536dce8722fd0c0e88301a6fe  kmi-baseline-v1.6.1.txt
76c58d9318a64fd97f4efcc91bb0267ee8a17f3f1a271d15c56541e68b9f1d58  kmi_check.py

